## 🚀 How to Run the Project

1. Open the project in the Wokwi Arduino simulator.
2. Ensure the DHT22 connections match the circuit connection table.
3. Install or enable the required sensor libraries.
4. Start the simulation.
5. Open the Serial Monitor.
6. Observe the temperature and humidity readings.
7. Change the simulated sensor values to test the alert conditions.

